  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Ingero za kode, JSON Schemas, n'inyandiko ngenderwaho za politiki zisomwa na mudasobwa bifite uruhushya rwa MIT keretse aho byanditswe ukundi. Ushobora kubikoresha ku rubuga rwawe bwite mu bwisanzure bwuzuye.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Aho winjirira uburenganzira bwose bwahuzwe",
