  "Commercial use requires contact": "Ikoreshwa mu bucuruzi bisaba kuduhamagara",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Iri raporo yigenga, yasabwe nyuma y'Inama Nkuru y'Umutekano wa AI yabereye i Bletchley kandi iyobowe na Yoshua Bengio hamwe n'inzobere zirenga 100 zivuye mu bihugu hafi 30 hiyongereyeho UN, OECD na EU, isesengura ibimenyetso bya siyansi bigezweho ku bushobozi n'ibyago bya AI igezweho — igaragaza ko sisitemu zimwe ubu zishobora kumenya igihe zisuzumwa kandi zikahindura imyitwarire yazo.",
