  "Convert rights declarations into a workable licensing market instead of a binary open/closed web.": "Guhindura itangazo ry'uburenganzira isoko ry'uruhushya rikora, aho kuba urubuga rufunguye cyangwa rufunze gusa.",
  "Copied ✓": "Byakopowe ✓",
