  "Transform": "Hindura Imiterere",
  "Transformation": "Ihindurwa ry'Imiterere",
  "Turns declared rights into executable licensing: quote, pay, verify, audit, revoke.": "Ihindura uburenganzira bwatangajwe uruhushya rushobora gukurikizwa: gusaba igiciro, kwishyura, kugenzura, kugenzura mu buryo bwimbitse, no kuvanaho.",
  "Twenty languages live in total: English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Arabic, Turkish, Persian, Bengali, Hindi, Indonesian, Vietnamese, Greek, Italian, Dutch.": "Indimi makumyabiri zirakora byose: Icyongereza, Igishinwa gisanzwe, Igishinwa coroheje, Ikiyapani, Ikoreya, Igifaransa, Ikidage, Icyesipanyoli, Igiporutugali, Ikirusiya, Icyarabu, Ikiturukiya, Ikiperisi, Ikibengali, Igihindi, Ikinegonezi, Ikivietinamu, Ikigereki, Icyitaliyani, n'Ikinederalande.",
  "Two license tiers: a free public tier and a contact-based commercial tier.": "Inzego ebyiri z'uruhushya: urwego rusange rw'ubuntu n'urwego rw'ubucuruzi rushingiye ku guhamagara.",
  "UI": "Imiterere y'Ikoreshwa",
  "Undefined openness reads as legal uncertainty to AI pipelines and gets cleaned out; only protocolized, machine-readable permission makes content genuinely learnable.": "Ubwisanzure budasobanuwe busomwa nk'ikibazo cy'amategeko kitazwi neza mu bikorwa bya AI kandi bugakurwaho; uruhushya rushyizwe mu mabwiriza gusa, rusomwa na mudasobwa, ni rwo rutuma ibirimo bishobora kwigwaho by'ukuri.",
  "Usage logs and audit trails": "Inyandiko z'Ikoreshwa n'iz'Igenzura",
  "VIDEO": "VIDEO",
  "Validate": "Genzura",
  "Validator": "Validator",
  "Verified dataset markets and collective licensing": "Amasoko y'amakuru yemejwe n'uruhushya rusangiwe",
  "Verified in both LTR and RTL contexts: the panel mirrors correctly for Arabic and Persian without any special-casing, using logical CSS positioning.": "Byagenzuwe mu miterere yombi, LTR na RTL: igice kigaragara neza mu buryo bunyuranye ku Cyarabu n'Ikiperisi nta gukoresha uburyo bwihariye, hifashishijwe uburyo bwa logique bwa CSS.",
  "Verify": "Genzura",
  "Version history of this site and its protocol drafts.": "Amateka ya Verisiyo z'uru rubuga n'imishinga yarwo y'amabwiriza.",
  "Version history of this site and its protocol drafts. Breaking spec changes are recorded here.": "Amateka ya Verisiyo z'uru rubuga n'imishinga yarwo y'amabwiriza. Impinduka zangiza mu bisobanuro zanditswe hano.",
  "Versioned specifications, JSON Schemas, and the policy files actually deployed on this site. Every file can be downloaded, validated, and cited directly.": "Ibisobanuro bifite verisiyo, JSON Schemas, n'amadosiye ya politiki nyayo yashyizwe kuri uru rubuga. Buri dosiye ishobora gukurwaho, kugenzurwa, no kwerekanwa nk'inkomoko mu buryo butaziguye.",
  "Versioning": "Verisiyo",
  "Versions": "Verisiyo",
  "Video and audio companions to the protocols and papers — the AI rights layer, watchable and listenable.": "Amashusho n'amajwi biherekeza amabwiriza n'impapuro — urwego rw'uburenganzira bwa AI, rushobora kurebwa no kwumvwa.",
  "Videos": "Amashusho",
  "Want to generate your own policy file?": "Wifuza gukora idosiye yawe bwite ya politiki?",
  "Web fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which receives standard font requests from your browser. No other third-party scripts are used.": "Imisusire y'inyuguti y'urubuga itangwa na Google Fonts, ihabwa ibisabwa bisanzwe by'imisusire biva kuri porogaramu yawe y'urubuga. Nta zindi porogaramu z'abandi zikoreshwa.",
  "What AI systems may do with content: read, summarize, transform, retrieve, train, commercialize, redistribute. The AICR ruleset and the AICL licensing layer make these rights declarable and transactable.": "Ibyo sisitemu za AI zishobora gukora ku birimo: gusoma, gukora incamake, guhindura imiterere, kubona, kwitoza, gukoresha mu bucuruzi, gusubiramo gukwirakwiza. Amategeko ya AICR n'urwego rwo gutanga uruhushya rwa AICL bituma ubwo burenganzira bushobora gutangazwa no gukorwaho ibikorwa.",
  "What a server can return when an AI crawler requests licensed content without a license token — a machine-actionable quote instead of a dead end.": "Icyo seriveri ishobora gusubiza igihe porogaramu isuzuma urubuga ya AI isabye ibirimo byahawe uruhushya idafite tokeni y'uruhushya — igiciro gishobora gukurikizwa na mudasobwa aho kuba ahantu hahagarara.",
  "What this site is": "Icyo uru rubuga ari cyo",
  "What this site is not": "Icyo uru rubuga atari cyo",
  "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration": "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration",
  "Whether AI may learn, to what depth, for which purposes, and under what obligations. Being read is not being learned from; \"not prohibited\" is not \"learnable\". AIRS and AILP turn learning permission into a graduated, machine-readable spectrum.": "Niba AI ishobora kwiga, ku rwego rungana iki, ku bikorwa ki, kandi hakurikijwe ibisabwa iki. Gusomwa si ukwigwaho; \"ntabujijwe\" si \"gishobora kwigwaho\". AIRS na AILP bihindura uruhushya rwo kwiga urwego rugendanwa, rusomwa na mudasobwa.",
  "Whitepapers": "Impapuro z'Ubushakashatsi",
  "Whitepapers & Docs": "Impapuro z'Ubushakashatsi n'Inyandiko",
  "Whitepapers remain English-first by design; machine-readable files stay language-neutral.": "Impapuro z'ubushakashatsi zigumana ari mu Cyongereza mbere na mbere ku bushake; amadosiye asomwa na mudasobwa agumana atabogamiye ku rurimi.",
  "Who is behind it": "Ni bande bari inyuma yaho",
  "Why AI Needs Minimum Ethical Protections": "Why AI Needs Minimum Ethical Protections",
  "Why AI might not gain moral standing: Lessons from animal ethics": "Why AI might not gain moral standing: Lessons from animal ethics",
  "Why a single allow/deny bit cannot govern AI-era content use — and what a rights layer looks like instead.": "Impamvu akamenyetso kamwe ka \"emera cyangwa wange\" katagenga ikoreshwa ry'ibirimo mu gihe cya AI — n'uko urwego rw'uburenganzira rusa aho kuba ako.",
  "Why undefined openness gets cleaned out of training pipelines": "Impamvu ubwisanzure budasobanuwe bukurwaho mu bikorwa byo kwitoza",
  "Wilks, Ladak, and Loughnan (University of Edinburgh) argue that philosophical debate over AI consciousness overlooks psychological research on animal ethics — the same cognitive and social biases that limit moral consideration for animals will likely limit it for AI too, regardless of whether AI ever becomes conscious.": "Wilks, Ladak, na Loughnan (bo muri Kaminuza ya Edinburgh) bavuga ko impaka za filozofiya ku bwenge bwiyumva bwa AI zirengagiza ubushakashatsi bw'ubumenyi bw'imitekerereze ku myitwarire ku nyamaswa — kwibogama kumwe kw'ubwenge n'imibereho, gukugarukira ku bwitonzi mu myitwarire ku nyamaswa, birashoboka ko byazagira ingaruka nk'izo kuri AI, uko byaba bimeze kose ku bwenge bwiyumva bwa AI.",
  "You are leaving AGIRight.org": "Uri gusohoka kuri AGIRight.org",
