  "verbatim_memory — whether exact reproduction is permitted": "verbatim_memory — niba kwisubiramo mu buryo buhwanye n'inyandiko y'umwimerere byemewe",
  "versioned, citable, traceable": "bifite verisiyo, bishobora kwerekanwa nk'inkomoko, kandi bikurikiranwa",
  "“AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” now published in English as the canonical edition; the Chinese original manuscript remains available and both versions cross-link.": "„AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” ubu yatangajwe mu Cyongereza nk'igisohoka nyakuri; umwimerere w'Igishinwa uracyaboneka kandi verisiyo zombi zihuza hagati yazo.",
  "“Protocolized Openness” confirmed as an English-language paper (with Chinese parallel passages) — no separate translation planned.": "„Protocolized Openness” yemejwe nk'urupapuro rwanditswe mu Cyongereza (rufite n'ibice by'Igishinwa biriho icyarimwe) — nta bindi buhinduzi butandukanye buteganyijwe.",
  "↑ live machine-readable policy of this site": "↑ politiki isomwa na mudasobwa y'uru rubuga, mu gihe nyacyo",
